Package: missionstudio
Version: @VERSION@
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-venv, python3-pip
Maintainer: missionStudio contributors <missionstudio@example.invalid>
Homepage: https://github.com/AVSLab/basilisk
Description: GUI mission-analysis application built on Basilisk
 A standalone, GUI-based mission-analysis application for spacecraft
 mission design, using the Basilisk astrodynamics framework (AVS Lab,
 University of Colorado Boulder) as its sole simulation/dynamics engine.
 .
 This package's own contents are pure Python and platform-independent
 (Architecture: all); Basilisk itself is downloaded from PyPI and
 installed into a dedicated virtual environment the first time this
 package is configured, which needs internet access.
